{"id":"664749","name":"藕夹","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/664749/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"莲藕","amount":"适量"},{"name":"前腿肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"莲藕去皮洗净切片备用。","img":"images/664749/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"前腿肉绞碎备用。","img":"images/664749/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入适量葱花，生抽，蚝油，玉米淀粉搅拌均匀。","img":"images/664749/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"取一片莲藕片，酿上肉馅。","img":"images/664749/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再取一片莲藕按压紧即可。","img":"images/664749/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"酿好的莲藕滚上一圈玉米淀粉。","img":"images/664749/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中热油放入莲藕夹。","img":"images/664749/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"中小火煎至微焦。","img":"images/664749/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/664749/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"适量蚝油，老抽和盐调味。","img":"images/664749/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"煮开转小火焖3至5分钟左右入味，收汁即可。","img":"images/664749/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664749/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664749/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664749/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664749/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}